(text "C152 VIN/PGND local loop; C153 VCC; C154 BST/SW requires differential probing.\nC206 T598X477M006ATE025470uF6.3V; case<=125C, rail<=3.6V; R15882mohm WSLP0603R0820FEA.\nCap ESR25mohm is maximum, not minimum; actual branched-loop validation remains required.\nR128 open isolates U121 for external5V:0.10A initial/0.90A ceiling; never parallel active sources.\nR153 open gives U151 source-only: investigate5V current>25mA; local R154 bleed remains.\nAfter off, verify TP151/TP203/C206.1 each<0.2V; split rails need separate checks.\nSee controlled bring-up contract for current loops, startup/load sequence and abort criteria." (at 17.78 257.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bd991a36-14a8-5f0a-ae74-ba5ad53bf94b"))
